amdrdna — RDNA+ native AMD GPU driver (skeleton)

Phase A0: loadable PCI kmod with RDNA1/2 PCI ID table and a
catch-all for post-Navi (IP discovery / RDNA3+) devices.
No MMIO, firmware, or DRM node bring-up yet.

Build (on a DragonFly source tree):

  cd sys/dev/drm/amdrdna
  make SYSDIR=/path/to/sys
  kldload ./amdrdna.ko
  kldunload amdrdna

Tunable: hw.amdrdna.log_level (0=error, 1=info, 2=debug)

PCI IDs in amdgpu_chip.c are derived from Linux v7.1
drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_drv.c (RDNA1/2 named ASICs).
